(VIDYUT VITRAN NIGAM LIMITED — Tender EE/WS/19/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers procurement of distribution transformers and lt cables) Tj T*
(complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(PART C — DISTRIBUTION TRANSFORMERS) Tj T*
(\(a\) Distribution transformers shall be designed and manufactured to IS 1180 \(Part) Tj T*
(1\):2014.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Transformer rating shall be 630 K.V.A., 11 kV / 433 V, Dyn11.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Transformers shall be outdoor type, mineral oil filled, naturally cooled, with) Tj T*
(copper windings.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Winding temperature rise shall be limited to 40 °C over a maximum ambient of 50 °C.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Transformer tank shall be fabricated from mild steel plates and epoxy painted.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: LT POWER AND CONTROL CABLES) Tj T*
(\(a\) LT power cables shall be XLPE insulated 1.1 kV grade armoured cables with aluminium) Tj T*
(conductors as per IS 7098 \(Part 1\):1988.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Continuous conductor operating temperature of XLPE cables shall be 90 °C.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Copper control cables of 2.5 sq mm shall be PVC insulated heavy duty type as per IS) Tj T*
(1554 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(\(d\) Cable conductors shall meet the resistance requirements of IS 8130 for class 2) Tj T*
(conductors.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Cables shall be laid directly in ground at a depth of 750 mm. with brick protection.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Terminations shall be made with brass double compression glands and tinned copper) Tj T*
(lugs.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Cable drums shall carry marking of size, type, length and manufacturer's name.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Each transformer shall be subjected to routine tests in accordance with IS 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
